# TryHackMe - Linux Fundamentals Part 1

## Overview
Completed the TryHackMe room "Linux Fundamentals Part 1".

This room introduced the basics of Linux navigation, file management, and searching from the command line. It provided hands-on practice with essential commands used daily in cybersecurity and system administration. :contentReference[oaicite:0]{index=0}

## Skills Learned

### Basic Commands
- `whoami`
- `echo`

### Filesystem Navigation
- `pwd` (Print Working Directory)
- `ls` (List files and directories)
- `cd` (Change Directory)
- `cat` (Display file contents)

### File Searching
- `find`
- `grep`
- `grep -R` (Recursive search)

